    that monster to this card.\r\n\u25CF You can target 1 \"Therion\" card you control
    and 1 card your opponent controls; destroy them.\r\nA \"Therion\" monster equipped
    with this card gains 700 ATK, also it can activate the 2nd effect listed above
    as if it were \"Therion \"Bull\" Ain\"."
